UID:6558-1783771200-1783785600@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Knitted Tank Top with April Jennings\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:July 11 and 25\, 2026\, 12-4 pm \nMake a summer weight tank top!  Learn the basics of garment construction; gauge swatch\, increasing\, and decreasing knitting in the round. \nThis is a beginner workshop\, but students need to know how to cast-on stitches\, knit\, and purl. \nStudents will provide their own materials. \n3-6 students \nRegister Here \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/knitted-tank-top-with-april-jennings-day-1
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/26-knitted-tank-top-April-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
